## 6. Quick Glossary

| Term | Simple Meaning |
|---|---|
| `posedge clk` | Clock ka "tick" — har tick pe hardware ek step aage badhta hai |
| `parameter` | Ek constant value jo module banate waqt set hoti hai (jaise function ka default argument) |
| SOF/EOF | Frame ka shuru/khatam batana |
| FIFO | "First In First Out" queue — jaise line me lagna |
| Checksum | Error-detect karne ka number |
| Endianness | Byte order — bada byte pehle ya chhota byte pehle |

